00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:46.256
and there's also no turn thing.

00:00:46.256 --> 00:00:48.693
- Now we've got this
matte liquid lipstick.

00:00:48.693 --> 00:00:49.717
You know what matte means?

00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:51.770
It's going to dry the fuck out of my lips.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:52.922
- That smells like a lipsmacker.

00:00:52.922 --> 00:00:55.348
