00:01:00.186 --> 00:01:01.354
I feel like I did it wrong.

00:01:01.354 --> 00:01:02.272
- Okay, it's drying.

00:01:02.272 --> 00:01:04.116
Okay, it's starting to
look a little better.

00:01:04.116 --> 00:01:05.108
